  <History Date="18-05-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (hopeless documentation)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="19-05-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's (DMX+Artnet modes only)" Version="3" />
  <History Date="15-11-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Unknown 760 Nano Wash Moving Head IP65 (RGBW) (charts are a mess.  assumed identical.  note some modes reference lime rather than white components but it is not consistent and the specs only have RGBW)" Version="4" />
  <History Date="17-11-23" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="5" />
  <History Date="05-01-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from PM Lights Nano Wash BX65 (identical.  charts are a mess.  suffers from the same problem with lime references.  tilt range in charts is different to specifications)" Version="6" />
  <History Date="09-01-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="7" />
  <History Date="04-05-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Flash Butrym EVENT WASHFX 500 IP65 (F7100787) (identical except 49 and 127 channel mode DMX/Artnet part split points which seems strange.  Colour macros refer to separate chart that is not available - left the same for now)" Version="8" />
